WEBVTT

00:18.830 --> 00:20.830
Great Master Buddha, they're here.

00:21.370 --> 00:21.910
Sit.

00:32.500 --> 00:33.570
Normally,

00:34.000 --> 00:35.860
I don't welcome the Zhang family,

00:36.700 --> 00:37.960
but since you're here,

00:38.450 --> 00:39.910
I can't make you leave now.

00:41.580 --> 00:42.960
Should we catch up first

00:43.030 --> 00:44.360
or get down to business?

00:45.100 --> 00:45.910
Zhang Hailou,

00:46.420 --> 00:47.820
tell him why we came here.

01:01.990 --> 01:04.190
Great Master Buddha, here's the thing.

01:04.550 --> 01:06.410
We're all surnamed Zhang, right?

01:06.430 --> 01:08.430
We are distant relatives after all.

01:11.410 --> 01:12.260
When we were in Xiacheng,

01:12.260 --> 01:13.970
we encountered something tricky.

01:13.970 --> 01:15.470
I suppose you knew.

01:18.789 --> 01:19.840
Now,

01:20.000 --> 01:21.200
we're short-handed.

01:21.950 --> 01:23.150
We... well... well...

01:23.150 --> 01:24.660
Since we are relatives,

01:24.680 --> 01:26.740
c-can you lend us several divisions?

01:32.610 --> 01:33.370
If he's still

01:33.370 --> 01:34.539
joking around,

01:35.039 --> 01:36.170
take them both away.

01:36.370 --> 01:36.789
Yes.

01:37.420 --> 01:39.750
What's your relationship with Mo Yungao?

01:40.070 --> 01:41.920
I know you are investigating him.

01:41.920 --> 01:43.120
You even sent someone

01:43.370 --> 01:44.300
to the Archives.

01:49.000 --> 01:50.000
A few days ago,

01:50.390 --> 01:51.830
I intercepted a telegram

01:52.200 --> 01:53.450
from Mo Yungao.

01:53.850 --> 01:56.970
I found that he was
secretly looking for the Archives.

01:57.560 --> 01:59.500
The Zhang family
has always been secretive.

01:59.500 --> 02:01.900
But Mo Yungao
found out about the Archives.

02:02.000 --> 02:02.880
That means

02:03.310 --> 02:05.000
something went wrong in the Archives.

02:05.000 --> 02:07.880
So I sent the adjutant to investigate,

02:07.970 --> 02:10.060
lest the Archives' secrets get out.

02:11.430 --> 02:13.030
So it's a misunderstanding.

02:13.890 --> 02:14.980
In that case,

02:15.580 --> 02:17.710
we can tell you what we know.

02:17.829 --> 02:19.960
And you tell us what you know in return.

02:20.250 --> 02:21.750
We have the same goal.

02:21.770 --> 02:22.950
Don't waste time.

02:27.170 --> 02:28.700
Let's get down to business.

02:29.910 --> 02:31.280
I-I'll make it short.

02:40.960 --> 02:41.980
So,

02:42.000 --> 02:43.260
the Southern Archives

02:43.300 --> 02:44.829
was taken down by Mo Yungao.

02:45.070 --> 02:45.880
Besides,

02:46.410 --> 02:47.410
you think

02:48.220 --> 02:50.950
he's going to spread
toxic weeds across the land.

02:52.440 --> 02:53.579
If you can provide

02:53.579 --> 02:54.750
the exact sites where Mo Yungao

02:54.750 --> 02:57.079
plans to deploy the toxic weeds elsewhere

02:57.110 --> 02:58.310
and secure evidence,

03:00.870 --> 03:02.730
I can report the matter to my superiors

03:02.730 --> 03:04.620
and forcefully take over his command,

03:04.620 --> 03:06.820
so that his troops will be held in place.

03:07.000 --> 03:09.190
You can also deal with him

03:09.190 --> 03:10.000
as you wish.

03:13.800 --> 03:14.800
But...

03:15.850 --> 03:17.320
if you can't,

03:18.250 --> 03:21.470
I'm afraid the higher-ups
don't want to cause more trouble.

03:21.470 --> 03:22.579
You want me

03:22.610 --> 03:23.850
to mobilize the Changxiang defenses

03:23.850 --> 03:25.200
to attack Beilian.

03:25.230 --> 03:26.829
That's utterly impossible.

03:27.110 --> 03:28.910
If you're willing to cooperate,

03:29.010 --> 03:30.700
we can give you the sites.

03:31.530 --> 03:33.000
But you must give us

03:33.780 --> 03:34.720
Mo Yungao's information.

03:34.720 --> 03:37.270
Mo Yungao is eccentric

03:37.290 --> 03:38.440
and very cautious.

03:39.010 --> 03:41.079
He doesn't have a regular residence.

03:41.100 --> 03:42.579
He has been living on the train,

03:42.579 --> 03:44.690
and this train has been running.

03:45.400 --> 03:46.780
So no one knows

03:46.800 --> 03:47.930
where exactly he is.

03:48.840 --> 03:50.930
The train he is riding on

03:51.180 --> 03:52.740
has been specially modified.

03:52.740 --> 03:54.730
Even if you find the train,

03:55.650 --> 03:57.850
I'm afraid you won't be able to board it.

04:00.150 --> 04:01.550
How has it been modified?

04:05.010 --> 04:07.090
I sent many experts

04:07.120 --> 04:09.650
to investigate
the whereabouts of the train.

04:20.490 --> 04:21.990
Mo Yungao's armored special train

04:20.620 --> 04:23.170
[Special Armored Train Blueprint]

04:22.040 --> 04:23.490
has 12 carriages in all.

04:23.760 --> 04:26.310
The second and the last ones
are gun carriages.

04:26.310 --> 04:28.310
Two cannons are mounted on the roof.

04:28.310 --> 04:29.690
The rotating turrets provide

04:29.690 --> 04:31.260
all-around 360° fire,

04:31.280 --> 04:34.080
with an effective range
of 8,000 to 10,000 meters.

04:34.350 --> 04:36.800
Next come 2 machine-gun carriages.

04:36.830 --> 04:39.320
Twelve heavy machine guns
are fitted along both sides,

04:39.320 --> 04:41.960
firing through side-wall firing ports.

04:42.220 --> 04:44.870
Their effective range
is 800 to 1,000 meters.

04:45.320 --> 04:46.950
As for the 7 carriages in the middle,

04:46.950 --> 04:49.680
no one knows exactly
which one Mo Yungao stays in.

04:49.680 --> 04:50.909
Soldiers inside the carriages

04:50.909 --> 04:52.500
keep watch around the clock

04:52.540 --> 04:54.390
via side observation windows

04:54.409 --> 04:56.750
and sight devices on the turrets.

04:56.290 --> 04:57.200
[Special Armored Train Blueprint]

04:57.350 --> 04:59.310
Any unauthorized approaching target

04:59.310 --> 05:01.740
will come under intense combined fire

05:01.770 --> 05:03.680
from cannons and heavy machine guns.

05:03.680 --> 05:04.300
No one

05:04.330 --> 05:06.260
can survive that fire.

05:08.180 --> 05:10.580
There must be a way to get on it.

05:12.260 --> 05:13.590
The train,

05:13.620 --> 05:15.200
due to special modifications,

05:15.200 --> 05:16.280
is very fast.

05:16.900 --> 05:17.640
And...

05:18.350 --> 05:20.270
and it will never halt

05:20.300 --> 05:22.120
before reaching the destination,

05:22.120 --> 05:24.450
and no one else
will be allowed to board it.

05:25.300 --> 05:26.500
Don't even think about it.

05:26.500 --> 05:28.960
It's impossible for you
to force your way in.

05:29.010 --> 05:29.840
With your intelligence,

05:29.840 --> 05:31.180
you surely can't get on it.

05:31.180 --> 05:32.640
You may think all you want,

05:32.950 --> 05:34.420
but you won't live to get on board.

05:34.420 --> 05:37.130
Anyone who even attempts to board it

05:37.770 --> 05:39.600
will be riddled with heavy fire.

05:41.840 --> 05:42.840
We are different.

05:42.880 --> 05:43.810
I must have a way.

05:48.320 --> 05:50.010
You said no one could find him,

05:50.590 --> 05:52.390
but you never said you couldn't.

07:26.660 --> 07:33.230
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

07:33.610 --> 07:36.260
[Episode 20]

07:42.690 --> 07:44.159
Mo Yungao

07:44.159 --> 07:46.990
is on his way to Nanling from Guangchuan.

07:47.720 --> 07:49.780
He will pass Changxiang Station soon

07:50.000 --> 07:51.870
and pass Chuhan Station at 3 a.m,

07:52.450 --> 07:54.780
then he'll continue heading for Nanling.

07:55.000 --> 07:56.159
At 1:30 p.m,

07:56.620 --> 07:58.950
the train will arrive at Nanling Station.

07:59.580 --> 08:01.250
All 4 stops along Mo Yungao's route

08:01.250 --> 08:03.850
align with the locations
deduced by Shrimpie.

08:04.680 --> 08:06.690
A few years ago, I met Mo Yungao

08:06.710 --> 08:08.310
on a few separate occasions.

08:11.460 --> 08:13.420
He once told me a story.

08:13.750 --> 08:15.060
About 20 years ago,

08:15.060 --> 08:16.830
there was an operation
to suppress bandits in Nanqiang.

08:16.830 --> 08:18.510
When Mo Yungao was a platoon leader,

08:18.510 --> 08:19.310
he led a suicide squad

08:19.310 --> 08:21.440
and encountered an ambush by bandits.

08:30.040 --> 08:31.250
Everyone else died.

08:31.570 --> 08:33.960
He was the only one who survived.

08:51.200 --> 08:53.070
H-Hero.

08:54.120 --> 08:55.650
If you don't leave quickly,

08:56.460 --> 08:57.820
you will die.

09:00.080 --> 09:01.370
You will die.

09:02.420 --> 09:03.830
You will die.

09:05.650 --> 09:06.580
I won't die.

09:08.580 --> 09:09.790
Where are you going?

09:13.200 --> 09:14.330
Into the mountains.

09:14.500 --> 09:15.900
Something is coming out.

09:18.520 --> 09:19.830
Help me up.

09:19.850 --> 09:20.710
Hero.

09:21.120 --> 09:22.150
Hero!

09:23.500 --> 09:24.620
Hero!

09:59.680 --> 10:01.010
Is there anyone alive?

10:05.420 --> 10:07.120
How many days have I slept?

10:07.280 --> 10:09.410
How did the body rot so badly?

10:37.410 --> 10:37.980
Who is it?

10:40.650 --> 10:41.370
Hero?

10:45.980 --> 10:48.340
Did you kill these bandits?

10:49.200 --> 10:49.950
Wait,

10:50.290 --> 10:52.040
s-since you are so capable,

10:52.070 --> 10:53.860
why didn't you save me then?

10:54.080 --> 10:54.660
Shut up.

10:55.580 --> 10:56.690
It killed them.

10:57.460 --> 10:59.120
That thing is coming out soon.

12:01.410 --> 12:02.200
Immortal.

12:18.840 --> 12:19.900
It's not safe here.

12:20.770 --> 12:21.580
Go back first.

12:24.850 --> 12:25.850
According to him,

12:26.410 --> 12:27.620
the mysterious man

12:28.200 --> 12:29.260
is surnamed Zhang.

12:30.170 --> 12:31.080
From then on,

12:31.110 --> 12:32.060
he thought

12:32.120 --> 12:34.120
he met a man of extraordinary gifts.

12:35.700 --> 12:37.360
A man of extraordinary gifts?

12:37.720 --> 12:38.580
Zhang Hailou,

12:39.090 --> 12:40.220
wait for me outside.

12:55.700 --> 12:56.260
My speculation

12:56.260 --> 12:58.240
lines up pretty closely with yours.

12:58.240 --> 13:00.220
His men tried to enter the Archives

13:00.690 --> 13:01.660
to find a file.

13:01.690 --> 13:03.310
It seems to be File 003.

13:04.030 --> 13:05.690
He's looking for that person.

13:09.190 --> 13:10.000
Miss Zhang.

13:12.150 --> 13:13.290
I don't know much.

13:14.290 --> 13:15.620
And I've told you everything.

13:15.620 --> 13:16.960
Separated by mountains and seas,

13:16.960 --> 13:18.560
this is our appointed place.

13:19.130 --> 13:21.500
I will wait for your news.

13:24.220 --> 13:26.020
We will pinpoint all exact sites

13:26.320 --> 13:29.340
where Mo Yungao
plans to deploy Twilight Grass this time.

13:29.340 --> 13:32.000
You must help us then.

13:43.100 --> 13:52.830
[Zhang's Residence]

13:49.390 --> 13:51.940
The Great Master Buddha has prepared food
and accommodation for you.

13:51.940 --> 13:53.070
This is the address.

13:59.390 --> 14:00.360
I have something to do.

14:00.360 --> 14:01.420
I won't see you off.

14:07.780 --> 14:12.280
[Zhang's Residence]

14:11.750 --> 14:12.250
Mentor,

14:13.360 --> 14:15.150
what secret stuff did you chat about

14:15.150 --> 14:16.940
with this snobbish relative
that I'm not allowed to hear?

14:16.940 --> 14:19.130
Mo Yungao knows about the Zhang family.

14:19.130 --> 14:20.630
Everything he's done

14:20.710 --> 14:23.170
is most likely targeted
at the Zhang family.

14:23.890 --> 14:25.510
But this deployment of Twilight Grass

14:25.510 --> 14:27.600
will also cause
massive civilian casualties.

14:27.600 --> 14:29.530
We must stop it as soon as possible.

14:29.980 --> 14:31.180
What about Shrimpie?

14:31.790 --> 14:32.770
Zhang Qishan intends

14:32.770 --> 14:35.600
to wipe out one of Mo Yungao's strongholds
along the Xiao River area.

14:35.600 --> 14:36.510
Currently, Zhang Haixia is the one

14:36.510 --> 14:38.440
who knows Twilight Grass the best.

14:38.510 --> 14:40.030
So, Zhang Qishan

14:40.510 --> 14:42.520
needs Zhang Haixia's help.

14:43.120 --> 14:45.320
I've ordered someone to take him there.

14:46.380 --> 14:47.150
What?

14:54.700 --> 14:56.270
[Regional Map of Nanling City]

15:04.410 --> 15:06.270
The situation is getting better.

15:06.340 --> 15:08.600
We are on the same boat with Zhang Qishan.

15:08.760 --> 15:11.090
We must find Mo Yungao
as soon as possible.

15:20.070 --> 15:22.570
Zhang Haixia has done a lot for this clue.

15:24.260 --> 15:26.190
We can't let his efforts go in vain.

15:44.350 --> 15:45.550
With Shrimpie's current situation,

15:45.550 --> 15:47.070
how can we let him act alone?

15:47.070 --> 15:49.580
He's with Zhang Qishan's troops.

15:49.810 --> 15:50.950
If anything goes wrong,

15:50.950 --> 15:52.000
they will step in.

15:52.250 --> 15:53.100
To kill him?

15:54.630 --> 15:55.600
If he could be killed so easily,

15:55.600 --> 15:57.200
he wouldn't be Zhang Haixia.

16:00.080 --> 16:01.810
What if he's not?

16:02.210 --> 16:03.450
If that's the case,

16:05.070 --> 16:06.380
it's his fate.

16:12.030 --> 16:13.560
Don't try to find him.

16:13.790 --> 16:15.720
You can't do whatever you want now.

16:16.130 --> 16:19.060
Haven't you learned enough
from the lessons before?

16:27.470 --> 16:28.800
Find Mo Yungao quickly.

16:30.330 --> 16:32.620
He's on the train to Nanling.

16:33.130 --> 16:34.890
What we need to do is to board it

16:35.980 --> 16:37.710
and kidnap Mo Yungao directly.

16:38.390 --> 16:38.960
Then interrogate him

16:38.960 --> 16:40.890
about the exact deployment sites,

16:41.860 --> 16:43.240
send a telegram to Zhang Qishan,

16:43.240 --> 16:44.600
and arrest him, right?

16:48.170 --> 16:50.570
Have you figured out
how to get on the train?

16:55.980 --> 16:57.980
This is the regional map of Nanling.

16:58.100 --> 16:59.510
Twenty li before reaching
Nanling Terminal Station,

16:58.230 --> 17:00.080
[Regional Map of Nanling City]

16:59.510 --> 17:00.630
the train passes through

17:00.630 --> 17:01.720
a cave tunnel.

17:02.200 --> 17:03.640
This cave is 500 meters long.

17:03.640 --> 17:05.920
This is the only way
we can get on the train.

17:05.920 --> 17:07.750
We just need to lie in wait
inside the cave in advance.

17:07.750 --> 17:10.410
When the train passes by,
we jump onto the train.

17:11.670 --> 17:13.319
But we only have 20 seconds.

17:15.920 --> 17:17.670
To get on a speeding train

17:17.750 --> 17:19.420
within 20 seconds.

17:20.200 --> 17:21.250
I'm fine with it.

17:22.069 --> 17:22.700
What about you?

17:22.700 --> 17:24.630
I suggested it, so I'm fine with it.

17:27.290 --> 17:28.660
What only matters

17:29.290 --> 17:30.380
is whether Zhang Qishan

17:30.380 --> 17:31.750
is worthy of our trust.

17:32.270 --> 17:34.240
While Zhang Qishan helps us,

17:34.240 --> 17:37.110
he can also completely seize control
of all Mo Yungao's defense zones

17:37.110 --> 17:39.040
and station his troops in Beilian.

17:39.140 --> 17:40.250
If we have caught

17:40.250 --> 17:42.000
Mo Yungao by then,

17:42.750 --> 17:45.160
as long as we know the deployment sites...

17:48.410 --> 17:50.700
Zhang Qishan will take his Beilian,

17:51.310 --> 17:52.000
and we

17:52.920 --> 17:54.790
will take Commander Mo.

17:56.750 --> 17:57.810
It sounds perfect.

17:59.570 --> 18:00.590
But you are drinking here

18:00.590 --> 18:01.530
and can't sleep.

18:01.950 --> 18:02.760
Why?

18:04.530 --> 18:05.880
I'm gonna test you.

18:08.290 --> 18:09.420
Outbreaks from Twilight Grass

18:08.340 --> 18:13.610
[Regional Map of Nanling City]

18:09.880 --> 18:11.940
hit countless villages
at the same time in Nanyang.

18:11.940 --> 18:12.680
That means

18:12.920 --> 18:13.790
outbreaks may hit

18:13.790 --> 18:15.520
these 4 cities at the same time.

18:16.070 --> 18:17.430
The key point

18:18.160 --> 18:19.530
is the time when Mo Yungao arrives

18:19.530 --> 18:21.190
at Nanling Terminal Station.

18:21.500 --> 18:22.640
The signal must be sent

18:22.640 --> 18:23.680
the moment he arrives

18:23.680 --> 18:24.750
at the terminal station.

18:24.750 --> 18:27.920
Then the Twilight Grass Poison
will erupt in 4 cities all at once.

18:27.920 --> 18:29.640
Once the poison breaks out,

18:29.670 --> 18:31.200
the cities will be in chaos.

18:31.340 --> 18:33.150
The water and land resources
in these cities

18:33.150 --> 18:35.480
will suffer irreversible consequences.

18:36.330 --> 18:37.110
What else?

18:40.770 --> 18:41.970
The Panhua Reef Case,

18:43.420 --> 18:45.880
the Nanyang Twilight Grass Poisoning Case,

18:46.030 --> 18:47.330
the trap on the Nan'an,

18:47.750 --> 18:49.530
and the slaughter in the Archives.

18:49.530 --> 18:50.070
These things

18:50.070 --> 18:51.610
seem to have no connection.

18:52.160 --> 18:53.030
But I guess

18:53.850 --> 18:56.290
they're all driven
by the same underlying objective.

18:56.290 --> 18:57.160
Look here.

18:57.540 --> 18:59.240
If I'm not mistaken,

18:59.410 --> 19:00.930
they hung up the bodies

19:01.220 --> 19:02.680
to collect corpse fluids.

19:14.460 --> 19:15.700
N P.

19:27.420 --> 19:29.020
And the Nanyang Evil God Case

19:29.570 --> 19:30.790
over 10 years ago.

19:30.920 --> 19:33.050
He is also the mastermind behind this.

19:33.060 --> 19:33.860
Twenty years.

19:35.500 --> 19:36.530
What could the Zhang family have

19:36.530 --> 19:38.860
that can make him plan
for 20 years in a row?

19:42.330 --> 19:44.130
You can think before you act now.

19:44.530 --> 19:45.110
Good.

19:46.670 --> 19:48.110
I taught you so well.

19:48.660 --> 19:49.580
Did you teach me that?

19:49.580 --> 19:50.580
Shrimpie did.

19:53.960 --> 19:56.020
I'm asking you. What's your purpose?

20:04.990 --> 20:05.650
Who is this?

20:09.790 --> 20:11.050
He's here to pick us up.

20:11.530 --> 20:13.110
I've sent my suspicions—

20:13.610 --> 20:14.410
same as yours—

20:14.700 --> 20:16.750
to Zhang Qishan via the guards.

20:21.750 --> 20:23.420
We can solve the problem soon.

20:25.450 --> 20:27.780
Hope everything goes well with Shrimpie.

20:36.590 --> 20:37.830
[Outskirts of Mo Yungao's Base,
Xiao River]

20:43.420 --> 20:44.030
Mr. Zhang,

20:44.460 --> 20:45.370
a few days ago,

20:45.460 --> 20:46.160
we found that

20:46.160 --> 20:47.610
Mo faction warlords maintain

20:47.610 --> 20:48.920
a hidden base deep in the Xiao River area.

20:48.920 --> 20:50.120
The Great Master Buddha suspects

20:50.120 --> 20:51.420
this may be linked to Twilight Grass

20:51.420 --> 20:52.420
you've spoken of.

20:52.590 --> 20:54.250
But we don't know much about it.

20:54.250 --> 20:56.110
That's why we need your judgment.

21:03.370 --> 21:04.190
Get off!

21:05.160 --> 21:06.030
Stand guard!

21:07.100 --> 21:07.820
Mr. Zhang.

21:34.700 --> 21:35.790
That is human skin.

21:37.500 --> 21:38.720
The black fuzz on top

21:38.850 --> 21:41.710
is residue left from burnt roots
of Twilight Grass.

21:44.660 --> 21:45.790
Twilight Grass mixed with corpses

21:45.790 --> 21:47.480
emits a distinct odor,

21:48.330 --> 21:50.460
which will linger for a very long time.

21:50.830 --> 21:52.300
I smelled it before.

21:55.110 --> 21:56.840
Unforgettable for a lifetime.

22:15.600 --> 22:17.170
This is Mo Yungao's doing.

22:17.530 --> 22:18.530
To be precise,

22:20.030 --> 22:21.920
Mo Yungao's men did it.

22:25.940 --> 22:26.530
Before we set out,

22:26.530 --> 22:29.390
we investigated Mo Yungao's
situation in Beilian.

22:29.410 --> 22:30.540
In the information,

22:30.880 --> 22:33.040
a military officer
named Li Pinrui is mentioned.

22:33.040 --> 22:35.280
He came back from Denasien.

22:35.530 --> 22:36.580
Now, he

22:36.720 --> 22:39.250
specializes in cultivating Twilight Grass.

22:39.270 --> 22:41.200
He's kind of Mo Yungao's henchman.

22:42.590 --> 22:44.500
This man has an eccentric disposition.

22:44.500 --> 22:45.750
He personally carried out

22:45.750 --> 22:47.570
all previous Twilight Grass poisonings

22:47.570 --> 22:49.630
across multiple regions of Nanyang.

22:52.330 --> 22:54.660
Over thousands of people died in Nanyang.

22:55.070 --> 22:56.070
This is the man

22:56.400 --> 22:57.460
we are to deal with.

22:59.290 --> 22:59.920
Mr. Zhang,

23:00.320 --> 23:01.640
do you think we can win?

23:03.920 --> 23:04.980
It doesn't matter.

23:06.790 --> 23:08.390
When dealing with villains,

23:09.610 --> 23:11.670
we should have a way to deal with them.

23:12.070 --> 23:13.250
Let's hurry on our way then.

23:13.250 --> 23:14.910
The enemy camp is right ahead.

23:17.610 --> 23:18.930
Guys, get in!

23:51.790 --> 23:52.610
Mr. Zhang.

23:53.640 --> 23:54.390
Mr. Zhang.

23:57.680 --> 23:58.500
Coming.

24:09.680 --> 24:11.310
We've conducted a preliminary survey,

24:11.310 --> 24:12.070
and this place is indeed

24:12.070 --> 24:13.850
where the Mo faction
cultivates Twilight Grass.

24:13.850 --> 24:15.980
It's under Li Pinrui's jurisdiction.

24:17.530 --> 24:19.370
The whole base is surrounded by mountains.

24:18.810 --> 24:19.660
[Outskirts of Mo Yungao's Base,
Xiao River]

24:19.660 --> 24:20.510
[Twilight Grass Cultivation Area]

24:19.780 --> 24:22.380
Judging from the scale of the base
and the number of patrols,

24:22.380 --> 24:24.790
there's likely an entire battalion
stationed here.

24:24.790 --> 24:26.720
On the other side of the mountains,

24:26.840 --> 24:28.280
there's a huge cave.

24:28.670 --> 24:29.410
The cave

24:29.430 --> 24:31.690
is where they cultivate Twilight Grass.

24:32.370 --> 24:34.610
Why didn't the Great Master Buddha
send more people here?

24:34.610 --> 24:35.790
The Great Master Buddha and the Mo faction

24:34.850 --> 24:37.640
[Main Gate] [Armory] [Sentry Tower]

24:35.790 --> 24:37.790
have different responsibilities
and jurisdictions.

24:37.790 --> 24:38.880
His reach can't extend this far.

24:38.880 --> 24:40.750
If he can't handle it well,
we'll be in big trouble.

24:40.750 --> 24:42.610
Our Great Master Buddha

24:42.750 --> 24:44.210
can only do so much at best.

24:44.380 --> 24:45.030
So,

24:45.170 --> 24:46.500
our Great Master Buddha needs you.

24:46.500 --> 24:48.020
We need to outmaneuver them,

24:48.020 --> 24:49.830
wipe out all Mo faction warlords,

24:49.830 --> 24:51.300
and destroy all Twilight Grass completely.

24:50.570 --> 24:52.690
[Main Gate] [Armory] [Sentry Tower]

24:55.500 --> 24:57.070
How are the troops deployed inside?

24:57.070 --> 24:58.110
According to my observation,

24:58.110 --> 24:59.110
the bulk of their troops

24:59.110 --> 25:01.110
are concentrated in the front base.

25:01.220 --> 25:02.530
They have adequate firepower.

25:02.530 --> 25:04.610
They train troops
and conduct experiments there.

25:04.610 --> 25:06.070
Since the cultivation area
lies within the cave

25:06.070 --> 25:08.110
and Twilight Grass is extremely hazardous,

25:08.110 --> 25:10.000
only a small detachment is stationed here.

25:10.000 --> 25:11.500
They only escort
local villagers here periodically

25:11.500 --> 25:12.920
to harvest Twilight Grass.

25:12.920 --> 25:15.380
The Great Master Buddha's mission
is to exterminate the Mo faction warlords,

25:15.380 --> 25:16.250
save the people,

25:16.250 --> 25:18.000
and destroy all Twilight Grass.

25:18.000 --> 25:18.420
Besides,

25:18.420 --> 25:19.880
we must finish the operation

25:19.880 --> 25:21.570
by the time Mo Yungao's train
arrives at Nanling Station

25:21.570 --> 25:24.700
and prevent any communication
between the two parties.

25:30.720 --> 25:33.650
Your Great Master Buddha
really thinks highly of me.

25:43.620 --> 25:45.030
You just said

25:46.220 --> 25:48.570
they'll all be exterminated,

25:49.670 --> 25:50.380
right?

26:01.920 --> 26:02.660
Mr. Zhang,

26:03.110 --> 26:04.290
what's our plan?

27:27.070 --> 27:29.330
This is where they plant Twilight Grass.

27:29.530 --> 27:30.880
Should we get ready?

27:32.290 --> 27:33.460
No need.

27:34.460 --> 27:38.190
Our operation must align with
the Great Master Buddha's timeline.

28:17.570 --> 28:19.350
They kidnapped villagers

28:19.370 --> 28:21.370
to harvest Twilight Grass for them,

28:21.610 --> 28:24.110
and once the villagers die,
their bodies get used as fertilizer.

28:24.110 --> 28:26.310
Truly making full use of everything.

28:26.460 --> 28:28.070
Burn this place down!

28:28.070 --> 28:28.610
-Yes!
-Yes!

28:28.610 --> 28:29.270
-Yes!
-Yes!

28:30.660 --> 28:31.530
Mr. Zhang,

28:32.580 --> 28:34.310
what instructions do you have?

28:40.000 --> 28:41.460
Gather all Twilight Grass

28:43.570 --> 28:45.070
for me.

28:50.070 --> 28:51.980
Pack it into these crates.

28:52.240 --> 28:54.130
Aren't we going to destroy it?

29:01.610 --> 29:03.570
I have my own uses.

29:48.920 --> 29:50.290
The grass is poisonous.

29:51.070 --> 29:53.220
Our men just
come into direct contact with it.

29:53.220 --> 29:54.820
Are you certain this is safe?

30:04.310 --> 30:05.640
Yes.

30:07.750 --> 30:10.610
I was infected
by the Twilight Grass Poison before,

30:11.890 --> 30:13.430
yet I'm unharmed.

30:23.510 --> 30:24.820
Go collect.

30:29.570 --> 30:30.110
Come on,

30:30.660 --> 30:31.720
start collecting.

32:09.420 --> 32:11.830
I won't let you die in vain.
